'''Kenshin Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event#Rurouni Kenshin|Rurouni Kenshin]] during the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 752
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Kenshin Cat
|name2 = Battosai Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Battosai Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Kenshin Cat attempts to be a combination of [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat]] and [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Viking Cat]], however, sadly fails to be good at being either. While it does have slightly lower base health than pre-[[True Form]] Viking Cat, it does have one less knockback. However, Viking Cat's True Form still outclasses Kenshin, as it gains over DOUBLE Kenshin's health. Rover Cat has a significantly lower cost than Kenshin Cat, on top of having one knockback and Warp Immunity, which lets it actually be useful against Starred Aliens. The True Form only further widens the gap between the two, giving Rover Cat even more immunities and an even lower cost.

To summarize, Kenshin Cat is a poor clone of Rover Cat and Viking Cat, and likely won't ever see use outside of early [[Empire of Cats]], [[Into the Future]] and [[Underground Labyrinth]].

